In release notes {{n_2098431_700-beta-release-notes_version_7.0.beta_edition_1.0_release_0-revision_7704383}} in the {{Compatibility and Interoperability}} section there is a very long line containing a list of possible scenarios:
{noformat}
     Method invocation on remote EJBs through RMI, IIOP, or over SOAP web services. - Security context propagation. - Transaction propagation. -* Remote EJB calls between JBoss EAP 7 and JBoss EAP 5 are now possible over IIOP. Between JBoss EAP 6 and JBoss EAP 7, the invocations are also possible via EJB API calls using JNDI. -* JBoss EAP 5 interoperability is supported using web services in the Beta release. -* JBoss EAP 7 provides messaging consolidation and backwards compatibility with JBoss EAP 6. The JBoss EAP 6 HornetQ codebase was donated to the Apache ActiveMQ project, and the HornetQ community joined to build a next-generation messaging broker. This was materialized in the first major release of the ActiveMQ Artemis project. ActiveMQ Artemis includes many new features, and also retains protocol compatibility with the HornetQ broker. JBoss EAP 7 includes this new exciting project as its JMS broker, and due to the protocol compatibility, it fully replaces the HornetQ project. 
{noformat}

For readability, this should be split into multiple lines.

I would like ask for changes in Development Guide at section _10.6.3.3. Browse and Manage Transactions: ask for changes_

* please note in section {{Delete a transaction}} that when transaction posses some participants they're not removed when this is called and are left being part of txn log.

_Transaction statistics_
* please create a new top level section (like 10.6.3.4) for topic of transaction statistics. I mean create a new section from text under title {{View Transaction Statistics.}}
* change text {{If Transaction Manager statistics are enabled, you can view statistics about the Transaction Manager and transaction subsystem.}} to something like {{...,you can view statistics 
on processed transactions by Transaction Manager}}
* please change the text {{transaction statistics are available via RuntimeStatusSubsystemsTransactions}} as it's not true. They're available by {{Runtime ->
 Server -> Subsystems -> Transactions}}
* Please change the text {{The number of timed out transactions processed by the Transaction Manager on this server.}} to something like {{The number of timed out transactions processed by the Transaction Manager on this server. The number of timed out transactions is calculated to number of aborted transactions too.}}
* Move columns of table {{Table 10.3. Transaction Subsystem Statistics}} _Participant ID_ and _List of all transactions_ to previous section. These two data does not have any connection to transaction statistics and rather shows info about transaction log.

