Additional investigation shows an issue in 
{code}
Utils.processImportHistory
{code}

When we close ZipInputStream it closes also related InputStream. In case of processImportHistory method it is "versionHistorySourceStream". And it caused IOException in case when we try to open second time ZipInputStream from same already closed InputStream.

Because of cycle ZipInputStream can be opened several times:
{code}
 for (String uuid : mapHistoryValue.keySet()) {
      ZipInputStream zipInputStream = new ZipInputStream(new BufferedInputStream(versionHistorySourceStream));
      byte[] data = new byte[1024];
...
{code}

Closing ZipInputStream and underlying versionHistorySourceStream
{code}
...
 zipInputStream.close();
{code}

