column47:
We plan to have new field "Display Name" in GateIn UI, which will be possible to set by users and it will be shown in right top corner in GateIn.

It would mean that class org.exoplatform.services.organization.impl.UserImpl will need to add new persistent field "displayName" with possible implementations like:

{code}
private String displayName = null;


public String getDiplayName()
{
   return displayName != null ? displayName : getFirstName() + " " + getLastName();
}

public void setDiplayName(String displayName)
{
   this.displayName = displayName;       
}
{code}

The code above indirectly means that if a display name could be found from the data store we will use it otherwise we will use the old value (First Name + Last Name). In other words the goal of this issue is to manage (storage included) an optional field "display name" in all the existing implementations of the organization service.

Please also note that getFullName/setFullName should be deprecated they will be replaced with getDisplayName/setDisplayName which means that getFullName should call getDisplayName and setFullName should call setDisplayName

