{noformat}
* Full+Incremental backup
{noformat}
> exobackup -u root -p gtn localhost:8080 start /repository 3600
{noformat}
* Full+Incremental backup with directly pointed _backup_dir_
{noformat}
> exobackup -u root -p gtn localhost:8080 start /repository /path/to/backup_dir 3600
{noformat}
* Restore of Repository from Backupset with backup Id
{noformat}
