{noformat}
* Restore of Repository from Backupset files 
{noformat}
> exobackup -u root -p gtn localhost:8080 restore /path/to/backupset/dir
{noformat}
* Restore of {{repsitory2}} Repository from the Backupset files and new {{repsitory2}} configuration
{noformat}
> exobackup -u root -p gtn localhost:8080 restore /repsitory2 /path/to/backupset/dir /path/to/repository2-config.xml
