   reader = dreader instanceof AdvancedDocumentReader ? ((AdvancedDocumentReader)dreader).getContentAsReader(is, encoding) : 
   														new StringReader(dreader.getContentAsText(is, encoding));
}
else
{
   reader = dreader instanceof AdvancedDocumentReader ? ((AdvancedDocumentReader)dreader).getContentAsReader(is) : 
   														new StringReader(dreader.getContentAsText(is));
}
2. NodeIndexer: Please use this occasion to clean the code, there are 2 places where we have new String(..) without the encoding given which could cause encoding issues
3. Ensure that there is no other places where we use the methods DocumentReader.getContentAsText, for example it looks like the class TextExtractorJob uses it

